OL,3,ABurnham to address MPs for first time
OL,4,Aas PM, as government borrowing costs
OL,5,Arise again
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham will soon address the
OL,8,FHouse of Commons - and take questions
OL,9,Ffrom MPs - for the first time as prime
OL,10,Fminister
OL,12,FMeanwhile, UK borrowing costs have
OL,13,Frisen again - see the recent climbs
OL,14,Fhere. Downing Street insists "fiscal
OL,15,Fdiscipline is the bedrock of economic
OL,16,Fstability"
OL,18,FBurnham met his cabinet this morning as
OL,19,FMPs return to Westminster after the
OL,20,Fsummer recess
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
